// Grok Snowie Sky Tours - SUPER SKY HIGH EXPANSION world (DLC #47). Built with the same World builder, kit props, regions,
// fades, solids and light pool as the valley (so it gets the Turbo look, culling and far-only LOD for free):
//   ❄️ Frostbite Isle: Cocoa Lodge (walk-in), ski hill + sleds, ice-fishing hut on the frozen pond, fences, lamps, drifts
//   🌋 Ember Isle: ridged layered volcano, glowing crater, slope-following lava flows, scorched trees, outcrops, steam vents,
//      Lava Lab (walk-in), observation deck, warning signs, Tortuga Tech heat-proof testing station
//   ⚔️ Fly High Arena: floating stadium bowl, crowds, jumbotrons, banners, floodlights, announcer booth, themed cover,
//      plus the lobby with the pit hangar (walk-in)
